{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-aberrant/1523674-dr-archeville-s-laboratory-characters-such","id":1523674,"title":"Dr Archeville's Laboratory - Characters & Such","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","The Trinity Continuum","Trinity Continuum: Aberrant"],"posts":[{"date":"2023-10-05T19:40:05-07:00","id":1523674,"title":"Dr Archeville's Laboratory - Characters & Such","content":"Hey folks. I recently for the <i>TC Aberrant</i> books (as part of backing <i>TC AEgis</i>), and I finally finished reading through them. I'd read most all the original <i>Aberrant </i>stuff, and made a few characters for it (but sadly never actually got to play), and thought I'd try to port them over to the new system.<br /> <br /> (I've played several other superhero RPGs over the past 30+ years, including Hero Games' <i>Champions</i>, Mayfair's <i>DC Heroes</i>, Palladium's <i>Heroes Unlimited</i>, TSR's <i>Marvel Super Heroes</i>, Green Ronin's <i>Mutants &amp; Masterminds</i>, and GOO's <i>Silver Age Sentinels</i>. And <i>Dungeons &amp; Dragons</i>, <i>Eclipse Phase</i>, <i>GURPS</i>, <i>Pathfinder</i>, <i>Rifts</i>, <i>Shadowrun</i>, <i>Vampire: the Masquerade</i>... and a few others I'm probably forgetting!)<br /> <br /> Index<br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-aberrant/1523674-dr-archeville-s-laboratory-characters-such?p=1523979#post1523979\">Baron Basteln</a>, The Quantum Mechanic<br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-aberrant/1523674-dr-archeville-s-laboratory-characters-such?p=1523675#post1523675\">Dead Head</a>, Unstoppable Super-Zombie","signature":"","edited":{"userid":28227,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28227-dr-archeville","user":"Dr Archeville","date":". 10-11-2023, 09:24 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28227-dr-archeville","name":"Dr Archeville","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar28227_2.jpg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-10-05T19:43:32-07:00","id":1523675,"title":"","content":"<b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Name:</span></span></b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"> Burton \u201cDead Head\u201d Lee</span></span><br /> <b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Concept:</span></span></b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"> Unstoppable Super-Zombie</span></span><br /> <b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Origin Path:</span></span></b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"> Suburbia 1</span></span><br /> <b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Role Path:</span></span></b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Medical Practitioner 1</span></span><br /> <b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Society Path:</span></span></b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"> Teragen 1</span></span><br /> <b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Additional Paths:</span></span></b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">None</span></span><br /> <b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Moment of Inspiration:</span></span></b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"> (Near?) Death Experience</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Burton \u201cBurt\u201d Lee grew up with a pleasant life in a suburban household, with two loving parents and two younger siblings. Only two things marked him as \u201cunusual\u201d: a fascination with horror movies, and frequent migraines. He did well in school, and went on to college, with dreams of becoming a neurologist &amp; finding a cure for his migraines. All that changed his senior year, when a Nova terrorist attacked his campus and caused the laboratory Burt was in to collapse. When rescue workers found his body, it had been crushed and pulped\u2026 yet still twitching. Over the next several days, Burt\u2019s body slowly knit itself back together, but not all the way: he now looked like a rotting zombie. (Most of the clinicians who oversaw his recovery thought his appearance &amp; abilities were, as with many Novas, a reflection of his interests and personality, but a few theorized that the neuronal impairments which caused his migraines had affected his Mazarin-Rashoud Node.) A few weeks later, a Teragen recruiter found him, and he never looked back.</span></span> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"> Dead Head is an oddity even among the Teragen. He is still as compassionate and loving as he always was, friendly to all he meets, eager to help strangers in times of need, tolerant to a fault... and largely incapable of noticing how creepy and <i>wrong </i>he comes off, or just how badly his &quot;idle fun&quot; (like snapping off a hand and having it crawl around like a spider, or stretching and twisting in ways no living person should or could) unnerves some people.</span></span><br /> <br /> <br /> <b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">SKILLS:</span></span></b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"> Command (Terrorizing) 3, Culture 1, Empathy 2, Humanities 1, Integrity (Fearless) 3, Medicine 1, Persuasion (Intimidating) 3, Science 1</span></span><br /> <br /> <b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">ATTRIBUTES:</span></span></b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">(Resilience Approach) Intellect 2, Cunning 1, Resolve 4, Might 2, Dexterity 2, Stamina 5, Presence 3, Manipulation 3, Composure 4</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><b>PATH CONTACTS:</b> </span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">???</span></span><br /> <br /> <b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">SKILL TRICKS:</span></span></b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"> Strength of Conviction</span></span><br /> <br /> <b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">EDGES:</span></span></b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"> Artistic Talent (Performance) 1, Big Hearted, Fame 2, Iron Will 3, Striking (Hideous)</span></span><br /> <br /> <b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">MEGA-ATTRIBUTES:</span></span></b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"> Mega-Resolve 1, Mega-Stamina 3, Mega-Presence 1, Mega-Composure 1</span></span><br /> <br /> <b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">MEGA-EDGES:</span></span></b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Adaptation, Dreadful Presence, Homunculus, Immunity, Toughness 2</span></span><br /> <br /> <b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">QUANTUM POWERS:</span></span></b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"> Plasticity 1 (Restricted - Can only extend out to about 4 meters, and compress down to about 12 cm/5 inches, does not gain Impact Resistant Soft Armor) </span></span><br /> <br /> <br /> <b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">QUANTUM:</span></span></b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"> 3 (Quantum Points: 25)</span></span><br /> <br /> <b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">TRANSCENDENCE:</span></span></b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"> 5 (Flux: 0; Transformations: Aberrant Eyes, Anima Aura, Physiological Shift, Psychological Shift, Vocal Shift)</span></span><br /> <br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><b>HEALTH:</b> </span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Bruised [+0], Bruised [+0], Injured [+1], Injured [+1], Maimed [+3], Taken Out</span></span><br /> <br /> <b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">ARMOR:</span></span></b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"> Soft 1 (Complete 3)</span></span><br /> <br /> <br /> <b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">EQUIPMENT &amp; GEAR:</span></span></b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">None</span></span><br /> <br /> <br /> <b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">SCALE:</span></span></b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"> Durability 2 (5 for resisting pain &amp; conditions), Leadership 1 (2 for resisting social influence), Mental 1, Might 1, Power 1, Size 1, Speed 1</span></span><br /> <br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Notes</span></span><ul><li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The 3 dots of Mega-Stamina, plus the Adaptation and Immunity Mega-Edges, were bought at half cost in exchange for adding 1 point (per dot) of Transcendence.</span></span></li> <li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Reduced cost of a dot in Quantum by 6xp by taking one mid-level transformation (Physiological Shift, to \u201cundead\u201d form)</span></span></li> <li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Reduced cost of 2 dots of Toughness by 3xp per dot by taking 2 low-level transformations.</span></span></li> </ul>\u200b","signature":"","edited":{"userid":28227,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28227-dr-archeville","user":"Dr Archeville","date":". 10-09-2023, 09:01 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28227-dr-archeville","name":"Dr Archeville","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar28227_2.jpg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-10-11T18:23:17-07:00","id":1523979,"title":"","content":"<b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Name:</span></span></b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"> Viktor \u201cBaron Basteln\u201d Altergott</span></span><br /> <b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Concept:</span></span></b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"> Quantum Mechanic</span></span><br /> <b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Origin Path:</span></span></b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"> Street Rat 1</span></span><br /> <b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Role Path:</span></span></b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"> Technology Expert 1</span></span><br /> <b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Society Path:</span></span></b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"> Elite 1</span></span><br /> <b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Additional Paths:</span></span></b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"> None</span></span><br /> <b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Moment of Inspiration:</span></span></b> See below<br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Viktor Altergott comes from a long line of German geniuses, but he never knew this, as he was orphaned at an early age. His mother died not long after giving birth to him, his father was confined to a mental ward before he was ten, and there was no other family to take him in, so he became a ward of the state. Chafing under the overwhelmed foster system, he soon slipped through the cracks and struck out on his own, and his innate knack for repairing and reforging saw him welcome in many homeless camps. While working on an insulin pump while the person it was attached to was in danger of slipping into a diabetic coma, he erupted, allowing him to create a vastly more efficient pump (and giving him psoriasis-like patches of metal and circuitry).</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Viktor never went to a Rashoud Clinic, continuing to focus on working with the homeless and underserved. When local drug dealers learned of a newly-erupted Nova working in their turf, they tried to kidnap him, but were turned away by deceptively simple yet devastatingly effective booby traps. (These traps served as an effective deterrent against overzealous law enforcement officers booking to break up the homeless camps, and other bigots.) He developed a healthy disdain for authority figures, so never considered becoming part of The Aeon Society or Project Utopia, and saw the Teragen as just another group that was lording their power over those who had none, so he stayed on his own path, helping who he could when he could.</span></span><br /> <br /> <br /> <b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">SKILLS:</span></span></b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"> Aim 1, Athletics 2, Close Combat 1, Enigmas 2, Larceny 1, Medicine 1, Pilot 1, Science 3, Survival 1, Technology (Repairs) 3</span></span><br /> <br /> <b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">ATTRIBUTES:</span></span></b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"> (Force Approach) Intellect 4, Cunning 4, Resolve 4, Might 2, Dexterity 2, Stamina 2, Presence 4, Manipulation 2, Composure 2</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><b>PATH CONTACTS:</b> </span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">???</span></span><br /> <br /> <b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">SKILL TRICKS:</span></span></b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Ahead of Your Time, R&amp;D Expert</span></span><br /> <br /> <b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">EDGES:</span></span></b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"> Always Prepared, Danger Sense, Demolitions Training 2, Fame 1, </span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><i>Keen Senses 2</i></span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, Ms. Fix It, </span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><i>Photographic Memory 1</i></span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, </span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><i>Speed Reading</i></span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, Weak Spots</span></span><br /> <br /> <b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">MEGA-ATTRIBUTES:</span></span></b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"> Mega-Intellect 2, Mega-Cunning 2, Mega-Resolve 2</span></span><br /> <br /> <b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">MEGA-EDGES:</span></span></b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"> Fast Worker, Inventor, Resourceful </span></span><br /> <br /> <b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">QUANTUM POWERS:</span></span></b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"> None</span></span><br /> <br /> <b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">QUANTUM:</span></span></b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"> 2 (Quantum Points: 20)</span></span><br /> <br /> <b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">TRANSCENDENCE:</span></span></b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"> 5 (Flux: 0; Transformations: Epidermal Shift, Psychological Shift)</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><b>HEALTH:</b> </span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Bruised [+0], Injured [+0], Maimed [+2], Taken Out</span></span><br /> <br /> <b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">EQUIPMENT &amp; GEAR:</span></span></b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"> ???</span></span><br /> <br /> <b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">SCALE:</span></span></b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"> Durability 1, Leadership 1 (3 for resisting social influence), Mental 3 (5 for Mega-Crafting), Might 1, Power 1, Size 1, Speed 1 (3 for initiative)</span></span><br /> <br /> <br /> Notes<ul><li><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Mega-Cunning (1 dot), Mega-Intellect (2 dots), and the Inventor Mega-Edge (2 dots) were all bought at half cost, in exchange for a point of Transcendence</span></span></li> </ul>\u200b","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28227-dr-archeville","name":"Dr Archeville","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar28227_2.jpg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4"}]},"thankedby":[